            {
              "grid": "6",
              "controls": [
                {
                  "value": "<p> </p>\n<p><strong>ON-SITE ASSESSMENTS<br /></strong><em>Have a Concrete Technologist visit your site.</em></p>\n<p>We can assess your works and provide practical, economical recommendations suited to you. <br /><br />If necessary, we can also guide a team to resolve any issues that arise from simple or complex failures.</p>",
                  "editor": {
                    "alias": "rte",
                    "view": "rte"
                  },
                  "styles": null,
                  "config": null
                },
                {
                  "value": "<p> </p>\n<p> </p>",
                  "editor": {
                    "alias": "rte",
                    "view": "rte"
                  },
                  "styles": null,
                  "config": null
                }
              ],
              "styles": null,
              "config": null
            }
          ],
          "styles": null,
          "config": null
        },
        {
          "name": "Article Split",
          "id": "1a4bc617-ddd5-4d25-8384-57f128f7fc09",
          "areas": [
            {
              "grid": "6",
              "controls": [
                {
                  "value": {
                    "focalPoint": {
                      "left": 0.5,
                      "top": 0.5
                    },
                    "id": 2453,
                    "udi": "umb://media/b9822d74be4b4dfb8cc87a9e8e549c00",
                    "image": "/media/oiwjfokl/hardened-concrete.jpg"
                  },
                  "editor": {
                    "alias": "media",
                    "view": "media"
                  },
                  "styles": null,
                  "config": null
                }
              ],
              "styles": null,
              "config": null
            },
            {
              "grid": "6",
              "controls": [
                {
                  "value": "<p> </p>\n<p><strong>HARDENED CONCRETE EVALUATIONS<br /></strong><em>Assess your hardened concrete.</em></p>\n<p>We can assess reinforcing depth and the many critical aspects affecting the strength of hardened concrete.</p>\n<p><em>Cover Surveys, Half-Cell Potential, Reinforcement Diameter, Reinforcement mapping, Crack Measurement, Rebound Hammer</em></p>",
                  "editor": {
                    "alias": "rte",
                    "view": "rte"
                  },
                  "styles": null,
                  "config": null
                },
                {
                  "value": "<hr />\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>",
                  "editor": {
                    "alias": "rte",
                    "view": "rte"
                  },
                  "styles": null,
                  "config": null
                }
              ],
              "styles": null,
              "config": null
            }
          ],
          "styles": null,
          "config": null
        },
        {
          "name": "Article Split",
          "id": "d040dd99-c182-40d2-ac71-cb340badb5a5",
          "areas": [
            {
              "grid": "6",
              "controls": [
                {
                  "value": {
                    "focalPoint": {
                      "left": 0.5,
                      "top": 0.5
                    },
                    "id": 1873,
                    "udi": "umb://media/1ffd181f19cd4692bca21cf0d9406cab",
                    "image": "/media/demp0h4n/gif-2.gif"
                  },
                  "editor": {
                    "alias": "media",
                    "view": "media"
                  },
                  "styles": null,
                  "config": null
                }
              ],
              "styles": null,
              "config": null
            },
            {
              "grid": "6",
              "controls": [
                {
                  "value": "<p> </p>\n<p><strong>UNDERGROUND SERVICE MAPPING<br /></strong><em>See into the ground beneath your feet.</em></p>\n<p>Get detailed maps showing storm water pipes, drains, sewers, electrical lines, fibre lines and voids underneath construction sites and earthworks.</p>\n<p><em>GS8000, GP8000 Ground Penetrating Radar.</em></p>",
                  "editor": {
                    "alias": "rte",
                    "view": "rte"
                  },
                  "styles": null,
                  "config": null
                },
                {
                  "value": "<hr />\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>",
                  "editor": {
                    "alias": "rte",
                    "view": "rte"
                  },
                  "styles": null,
                  "config": null
                }
              ],
              "styles": null,
              "config": null
            }
          ],
          "styles": null,
          "config": null
        },
        {
          "name": "Article Split",
          "id": "41d594e7-ae79-4fa0-9132-d57ef221c1fc",
          "areas": [
            {
              "grid": "6",
              "controls": [
                {
                  "value": {
                    "focalPoint": {
                      "left": 0.5,
                      "top": 0.5
                    },
                    "id": 2452,
                    "udi": "umb://media/16154e728d614f7d957f5dfede1841d7",
                    "image": "/media/orhbkftb/wet-concrete.jpg"
                  },
                  "editor": {
                    "alias": "media",
                    "view": "media"
                  },
                  "styles": null,
                  "config": null
                }
              ],
              "styles": null,
              "config": null
            },
            {
              "grid": "6",
              "controls": [
                {
                  "value": "<p> </p>\n<p><strong>WET CONCRETE SERVICES <br /></strong><em>Unique mix designs and services.</em></p>\n<p>We can create unique concrete mix designs and monitor the hydration and changing temperature of cementitious materials in a concrete mixture.</p>\n<p><em>Concrete Mix Designs, Heat of Hydration Monitoring.</em></p>",
                  "editor": {
                    "alias": "rte",
                    "view": "rte"
                  },
                  "styles": null,
                  "config": null
                },
                {
                  "value": "<hr />\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>",
                  "editor": {
                    "alias": "rte",
                    "view": "rte"
                  },
                  "styles": null,
                  "config": null
                }
              ],
              "styles": null,
              "config": null
            }
          ],
          "styles": null,
          "config": null
        },
        {
          "name": "Article Split",
          "id": "db56be10-4af9-49ec-8232-9a801aea468d",
          "areas": [
            {
              "grid": "6",
              "controls": [
                {
                  "value": {
                    "focalPoint": {
                      "left": 0.5,
                      "top": 0.5
                    },
                    "id": 1871,
                    "udi": "umb://media/70635689442c4ae1b46ef6e6733dc361",
                    "image": "/media/r3lgg2bm/gif-3.gif"
                  },
                  "editor": {
